<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`HORIZONTAL: number = 1`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer HORIZONTAL = 1;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant HORIZONTAL has the value 1</p>
  <p>Constant to indicate that the orientation of the capsule for a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Pathfinding" target="_blank">Pathfinding</a> character is horizontal.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
